BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738.0 Td (A plan that is not exercised is only a hypothesis. HPE maintains a continuous testing calendar:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 718.0 Td (- Tabletop exercises quarterly, walking leadership and technical teams through scenarios such as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 704.0 Td (  regional outage, ransomware, and supply-chain disruption.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690.0 Td (- Functional drills and failover simulations semi-annually, executing live cutover of GreenLake) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 676.0 Td (  and SAP S/4HANA to the hot-site and measuring actual RTO/RPO against targets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 662.0 Td (- Full recovery validation at least annually, including immutable-backup restore into an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 648.0 Td (  isolated recovery environment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628.0 Td (Every exercise produces an after-action report; findings feed a corrective-action tracker with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 614.0 Td (owners and deadlines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 594.0 Td (---) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 568.0 Td (7. Plan Maintenance and Review) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 545.0 Td (This plan is a living document. Formal review and updates occur on an annual cycle and are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 531.0 Td (additionally triggered by significant infrastructure changes, acquisitions, exercise findings, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 517.0 Td (lessons learned from real incidents. Maintenance responsibilities-keeping current the contact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 503.0 Td (rosters, runbooks, dependency maps, and recovery targets-are assigned to the Office of Business) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 489.0 Td (Resilience, which certifies the plan's accuracy each fiscal year and reports readiness to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 475.0 Td (Board's risk committee.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 455.0 Td (---) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 435.0 Td (*Approved by the HPE Business Resilience Steering Committee.*) Tj ET
